note top of INPUTS
  Keep the prepared compiler inputs outside
  this recipe to avoid implicit downloads.
  It checks the supplied upstream install
  marker and config version before Cargo
  builds the selected GPU feature.
end note

note bottom of LOCAL
  Local checks cover recipe text and the
  default CPU path, not real GPU kernels.
  The selected host must still prove double
  precision scores, gradients and updates
  with reload and matching learner digests.
end note

note bottom of OPERATOR_PACKET
  Client deadlines request termination;
  they do not prove a physical host stop.
  Cleanup uses only this run's saved
  container ID, and missing evidence
  cannot count as successful removal.
end note

note bottom of LOOKUP
  Shell paths describe the client machine,
  not the host that launches the runtime.
  Missing installation and service PATH remain
  unresolved because no evidence identifies
  the actual daemon execution host.
end note

